# [f5g] End-to-end trace parent across free5GC's call graph. Shared parts live in
# free5gc-otel/f5gtrace, util-patched/logger (gin middleware) and openapi-patched (client transport).
# Per-NF parts (this file): root spans in the AMF NGAP and SMF PFCP (DLDR) dispatchers, NAS/SUPI
# annotation, and f5gtrace.Go on the goroutine hand-offs that lead to SBI calls.
# Note: amf callback.go also carries the duplicate-PSI hunks (amf-duplicate-psi-reprocess.patch).

